# corona_confound_matrix.te — TE-Probes-Wanderung: the corona_confound_matrix_probe as a
# conditional TE matrix over the registered solar EUV/X-ray fields.
# channels: the 7 AIA bands (aia_94_dn .. aia_335_dn, phi/sources.φ:1830-1836) + the two
#   GOES XRS channels (goes_xrs_xrsa/goes_xrs_xrsb, phi/sources.φ:901-902) — the probe's
#   nine actors (corona_confound_matrix_probe.rs:13-31: LADDER = 7 AIA, CHANNELS = 304/131,
#   CONFOUNDERS = 171/193/211/335/94/goes).
# cond rest: every ordered pair (d,t) is conditioned on the pool minus {d,t} — the probe's
#   per-confounder conditional TE (conditional_te_stats / transfer_entropy_conditional_h),
#   the confounder never a fixed arm.
# cadence: 24-s cells (corona_confound_matrix_probe.rs:5 DT 24.0); lags 0,4,8 (:10 LAGS);
#   phase-randomized surrogates (surrogate_stats_phase).
matrix corona-confound full
register sources
channels aia_94_dn,aia_131_dn,aia_171_dn,aia_193_dn,aia_211_dn,aia_304_dn,aia_335_dn,goes_xrs_xrsa,goes_xrs_xrsb
cond rest
fdr bh 0.05 over matrix
expect cells 72
lags 0,4,8
surrogate 10
cadence live
bin 24
seasonal none
